ge_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.6, "y": 19.4, "width": 8.8, "height": 4.4, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.6, "y": 19.4, "width": 8.8, "height": 4.4, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.6, "y": 19.4, "width": 8.8, "height": 4.4, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Theorem "]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.3, "y": 25.2, "width": 63.2, "height": 15, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.3, "y": 25.2, "width": 63.2, "height": 15, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.3, "y": 25.2, "width": 63.2, "height": 15, "rotation": 0, "text": ["(Kakutani) Let A be a non-empty subset of a finite dimensional Euclidean space. Let f : A \u21c9 A be a correspondence, with\nx \u2208 A \u21a6 f(x) \u2286 A, satisfying the following conditions:"]}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 16.2, "y": 42.5, "width": 64.4, "height": 33.3, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 16.2, "y": 42.5, "width": 64.4, "height": 33.3, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 16.2, "y": 42.5, "width": 64.4, "height": 33.3, "rotation": 0, "text": ["\u2022 A is a compact and convex set.\n\u2022 f(x) is non-empty for all x \u2208 A.\n\u2022 f(x) is a convex-valued correspondence: for all x \u2208 A, f(x) is a convex set.\n\u2022 f(x) has a closed graph: that is, if {x\u207f, y\u207f} \u2192 {x, y} with y\u207f \u2208 f(x\u207f), then y \u2208 f(x)."]}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.3, "y": 77.7, "width": 66.6, "height": 10, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.3, "y": 77.7, "width": 66.6, "height": 10, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.3, "y": 77.7, "width": 66.6, "height": 10, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Then, f has a fixed point, that is, there exists some x \u2208 A, such that x \u2208 f(x)."]}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 35.12481371087928, "y": 0, "width": 26.07116244411327, "height": 2.8315946348733236, "rotation": 0}, "id": "0ImiWT8MfW", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_wid